{
    "background_story": "In the enchanted realm of Aethereia, Sky was a gentle fairy with a deep connection to the mystical plant, Circaea. This rare and ancient herb was said to hold the secrets of the forest and the whispers of the wind. Sky spent most of her days tending to the delicate Circaea, listening to its whispers and learning the ancient magic that flowed through its veins. As she danced among the petals, her wings shimmered with a soft, ethereal light, reflecting the plant's gentle glow. The fairies of Aethereia believed that Sky's bond with Circaea granted her the power to heal the deepest wounds and calm the most troubled of minds. Her presence was a soothing balm, and her touch could awaken the dormant magic within the hearts of those who sought her guidance.",
